<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Wednesday in men's</p>
<p>EuroLeague basketball:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Panathinaikos (Greece) 72 Split (Croatia) 50 (halftime</p>
<p>30-23)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - John Amaechi 17, Frangiskos Alvertis 11,</p>
<p>Hugo Sconochini 11</p>
<p>Split - Goran Kalamiza 13, Nikola Vujcic 11, Josko Poljak 8</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,500</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Villeurbanne:</p>
<p>Villeurbanne (France) 70 Ljubljana (Slovenia) 69 (35-43)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Villeurbanne - Digbeu 17, Rudd, 16, Bilba 15</p>
<p>Ljubljana - Henrie 20, Tusek 15, Milic 9</p>
<p>Group D </p>
<p>Caja San Fernando (Spain) 91 Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 61</p>
<p>(43-30)</p>
<p>Add Group C</p>
<p>In Barcelona:</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) 90  Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 71 (41-28)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Bologna: Teamsystem Bologna (Italy) 82 Alba Berlin</p>
<p>(Germany) 72 (33-37).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bologna - Myers 28, McRae 12, Crotty 9, Vescovi 9</p>
<p>Berlin - Huppmann 15, Alexis 13, Roedl 12, Obradovic 11</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,470</p>
